            <ArticleTitle>Evolution of OPCAB surgery in a single institution.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>514-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Off-pump coronary artery bypass (OPCAB) grafting is becoming popular worldwide. The development of exposure and stabilization techniques have made this surgery a simple, safe, and routine procedure. The evolution of OPCAB surgery at our institution is presented and discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
